## .gitignore for a .NET (C#) solution: WinForms + Blazor WebAssembly + class libraries
## Based on the standard GitHub "VisualStudio" template, trimmed to what applies here.

## ---------- Visual Studio / VS Code / Rider ----------
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.userprefs
*.rsuser
launchSettings.json.user
*.DotSettings.user
_ReSharper*/
*.[Rr]e[Ss]harper
.localhistory/

## ---------- Build output ----------
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Dd]ebug/
[Dd]ebugPublic/
[Rr]elease/
[Rr]eleases/
x64/
x86/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]64/
bld/
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/
*.log

## ---------- Publish output ----------
publish/
PublishScripts/
*.pubxml
*.pubxml.user
*.publishproj
*.[Pp]ublish.xml
*.azurePubxml

## ---------- Blazor WebAssembly ----------
## Compiled framework/static output (regenerated on build)
**/wwwroot/_framework/
**/wwwroot/_content/
**/wwwroot/*.br
**/wwwroot/*.gz

## ---------- NuGet ----------
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
**/[Pp]ackages/*
!**/[Pp]ackages/build/
*.nuget.props
*.nuget.targets
project.lock.json
project.fragment.lock.json
artifacts/

## ---------- Test results & coverage ----------
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/
[Bb]uild[Ll]og.*
*.trx
*.coverage
*.coveragexml
coverage*.json
coverage*.xml
coverage*.info
TestResults/
*.VisualState.xml
TestResult.xml
nunit-*.xml

